      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Canadian Experience Class (CEC) 2026: Requirements, Draws and the New CRS Points
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-4">
        Who qualifies, how 2026 CEC rounds actually played out, what the November 3, 2026 CRS changes mean for people already working in Canada, and how to time your move from a work permit to permanent residence.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <time datetime="2026-11-15">November 15, 2026</time>
        <span>&bull;</span>
